  antigravity now reaches shared memory through the daemon.

  NOTE: this run switched antigravity only. Still on the previous arrangement:
    - claude
    - copilot
  They will contend for the memory lock with antigravity until they switch too.
  Switch the whole machine at once with: task mempalace:switch-http

